OL,3,GNEWSACause of fire that destroyed
OL,4,Aheathland unknown
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been unable to
OL,7,Ffind the cause of a fire that wrecked
OL,8,Fpart of a heathland in Norwich.
OL,10,FSmoke billowed from Mousehold Heath on
OL,11,Fthe outskirts of the city on 13 August,
OL,12,Fshortly after Norfolk Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService (NFRS) declared a major
OL,14,Fincident due to a large number of
OL,15,Fcall-outs.
OL,17,FCrews from 28 of Norfolk's 42 fire
OL,18,Fstations attended the blaze at its
OL,19,Fheight and an area of about 30,000 sq m
OL,20,F- about the size of four football
OL,21,Fpitches - was destroyed.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
