OL,3,GNEWSACause of fire that destroyed
OL,4,Aheathland unknown
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Unfortunately, due to the destruction
OL,7,Fof the area and extensive scale of the
OL,8,Ffire damage, we have not been able to
OL,9,Fdetermine the cause of the fire on this
OL,10,Foccasion," said Emyr Gough, NFRS head
OL,11,Fof prevention and protection.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
